PortProtonQt has the following optional dependencies:
- exiftool: Reads file metadata
- mesa-demos: Detects 3D graphics drivers and system capabilities
- pciutils: Detects exact graphics card model
- unrar: Extracts RAR archives
- unzip: Extracts ZIP archives
- qt6-imageformat: For animated (GIF, WebM) covers
- qt6-multimedia: Allows playing interface sounds

For unrar you need nonfree-repo:
# xbps-install -S void-repo-nonfree

# xbps-install -S exiftool mesa-demos pciutils unrar unzip qt6-imageformat qt6-multimedia

For correct work system manager (ppqtos) you need:
- NetworkManager: System tab network management
- bluez: System tab bluetooth management
- upower: System tab bluetooth battery level
- libpulseaudio: System tab audio volume/output management
- python3-qrcode: Wi-Fi QR code generation

# xbps-install -S NetworkManager bluez upower libpulseaudio python3-qrcode 
